  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Gender Equity and Transparency in Budgetary Governance in Addis Ababa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &apos;Advancing Gender Equity and Transparency in Budgetary Governance in Addis Ababa&apos; aims to improve fiscal accountability and gender-responsive resource allocation in Addis Ababa City Administration, ensuring that at least 500 citizens (60% women, 30% youth aged 18-35, 10% persons with disabilities) can access and utilize simplified gender budget information, and securing at least 1 documented policy commitment from City Administration for increased gender-targeted budget allocations in the 2026/27 fiscal year.</narrative>
  </description>
